  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Does happy music make you feel more excited?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.58
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, of course. When I'm already in a happy mood, listening to happy music makes me feel even happier. And when I'm just calm, happy music can lift me up and get me excited too. For example, when I get up early and need to go out to start my day, I put on my earphones and play happy music — I think that helps me begin a happy day.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 3.09,
      "end": 21.29
    }
